d over and flew away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l007","ordinal":170097,"en":"Dear Lord Toltoy's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l008","ordinal":170098,"en":"Ribs and heart jolted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l009","ordinal":170099,"en":"And his filthy guts quivered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l010","ordinal":170100,"en":"Hero Toltoy stood amazed:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l011","ordinal":170101,"en":"Had thunder suddenly crashed?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l012","ordinal":170102,"en":"What strange mystery was this?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l013","ordinal":170103,"en":"Had the earth broken apart?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l014","ordinal":170104,"en":"Was there a black-ridged mountain?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l015","ordinal":170105,"en":"What age and what day was this?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l016","ordinal":170106,"en":"Had an enemy come from the Khagan?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l017","ordinal":170107,"en":"The earth broke and made a sound;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l018","ordinal":170108,"en":"Was there an enemy coming to devour him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l019","ordinal":170109,"en":"Was there a bullet wrapped in haze,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l020","ordinal":170110,"en":"Coming in an unbroken, roaring mass"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l021","ordinal":170111,"en":"Toward them?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l022","ordinal":170112,"en":"Hero Toltoy took courage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l023","ordinal":170113,"en":"If an eager enemy had come,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l024","ordinal":170114,"en":"He would slaughter them with his sword;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l025","ordinal":170115,"en":"Let forty thousand enemies appear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l026","ordinal":170116,"en":"He would bring them all to their end."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1231:b004:l027","ordinal":170117,"en":"He raged and made 