y chance"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l011","ordinal":170140,"en":"And cut him with my sword."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l012","ordinal":170141,"en":"I will bring the axe down"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l013","ordinal":170142,"en":"Upon this impudent boy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l014","ordinal":170143,"en":"And spill his blood like an albasty.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l015","ordinal":170144,"en":"He turned Surkoen's head;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l016","ordinal":170145,"en":"The leopard Sultan Toltoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l017","ordinal":170146,"en":"Stood waiting for the boy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l018","ordinal":170147,"en":"Shouting, \"Manas! Manas!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l019","ordinal":170148,"en":"Calling the battle cry \"Manas,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l020","ordinal":170149,"en":"He came crying, \"Manas! Manas!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l021","ordinal":170150,"en":"The battle cry spoken in Manas's name"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l022","ordinal":170151,"en":"Deafened ears and noses."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l023","ordinal":170152,"en":"When Toltoy looked again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l024","ordinal":170153,"en":"Where he stood became a deep ravine;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l025","ordinal":170154,"en":"His own eyelashes became enemies."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l026","ordinal":170155,"en":"Toltoy of the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l027","ordinal":170156,"en":"Lost heart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l028","ordinal":170157,"en":"And in hero Toltoy's eyes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l029","ordinal":170158,"en":"Mountain-like Manas appeared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l030","ordinal":170159,"en":"When Toltoy looked carefully,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l031","ordinal":170160,"en":"As the boy cried \"Manas!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l032","ordinal":170161,"en":"Hundreds led by Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l033","ordinal":170162,"en":"Streamed out of the marsh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l034","ordinal":170163,"en":"And thousands led by Bakay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l035","ordinal":170164,"en":"Surged out behind them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l036","ordinal":170165,"en":"Wearing a coat of yellow gold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l037","ordinal":170166,"en":"Mounted on a piebald horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l038","ordinal":170167,"en":"With a bare sword at his side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b003:l039","ordinal":170168,"en":"He circled in fury."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l001","ordinal":170169,"en":"The sight made hearts waver;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l002","ordinal":170170,"en":"He showed the form of a taker of souls."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l003","ordinal":170171,"en":"Whipping the piebald horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l004","ordinal":170172,"en":"Almambet raised the battle cry:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l005","ordinal":170173,"en":"\"Seize him, seize him, seize him!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l006","ordinal":170174,"en":"\"If you seize him, kill him!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l007","ordinal":170175,"en":"Bind both his hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l008","ordinal":170176,"en":"Gouge out both his eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l009","ordinal":170177,"en":"And only then kill him!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l010","ordinal":170178,"en":"With hungry shout and fierce battle cry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l011","ordinal":170179,"en":"Whom no wrestler could overpower,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l012","ordinal":170180,"en":"And no lion's tooth could pierce,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l013","ordinal":170181,"en":"Wearing a blue rapys coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l014","ordinal":170182,"en":"Mounted on a mottled blue horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l015","ordinal":170183,"en":"Chubak of Akbaltay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l016","ordinal":170184,"en":"Raised the cry behind him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l017","ordinal":170185,"en":"And became his support."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l018","ordinal":170186,"en":"Hero Toltoy of the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l019","ordinal":170187,"en":"Lost heart;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l020","ordinal":170188,"en":"It seemed as though the usual lion Khan Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l021","ordinal":170189,"en":"Had appeared alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l022","ordinal":170190,"en":"\"They will bring me to my end,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l023","ordinal":170191,"en":"Destroy us all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l024","ordinal":170192,"en":"And bind boastful Kojo"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l025","ordinal":170193,"en":"And carry him away alive!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l026","ordinal":170194,"en":"It is leopard Manas himself;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l027","ordinal":170195,"en":"How could he spare a life?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l028","ordinal":170196,"en":"It is valiant Bakay himself;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l029","ordinal":170197,"en":"This means he will bring torment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l030","ordinal":170198,"en":"Can one who challenges him live?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l031","ordinal":170199,"en":"Can one who confronts him survive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l032","ordinal":170200,"en":"Will the living leopard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l033","ordinal":170201,"en":"Bring us to our end like this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l034","ordinal":170202,"en":"Take us alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l035","ordinal":170203,"en":"Drag us along the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l036","ordinal":170204,"en":"And offer us as sacrifices?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l037","ordinal":170205,"en":"Will I stand and match him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l038","ordinal":170206,"en":"Let myself be sacrificed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1232:b004:l039","ordinal":170207,"en":"And be dragged along the road?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l001","ordinal":170208,"en":"Be offered as a sacrifice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l002","ordinal":170209,"en":"Be crushed upon the steppe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l003","ordinal":170210,"en":"And torn apart by the Dangyts?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l004","ordinal":170211,"en":"Rather than die on the open plain"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l005","ordinal":170212,"en":"And endure such suffering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l006","ordinal":170213,"en":"I will flee into my ranks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l007","ordinal":170214,"en":"Gather my host,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l008","ordinal":170215,"en":"And begin a mass battle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l009","ordinal":170216,"en":"Rather than die on the open plain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l010","ordinal":170217,"en":"I will die without regret."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l011","ordinal":170218,"en":"I told him before—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l012","ordinal":170219,"en":"Did he not heed me then?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l013","ordinal":170220,"en":"Ravined spring and sheer cliff,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l014","ordinal":170221,"en":"Fiery, cunning Churok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l015","ordinal":170222,"en":"Has men girded for battle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l016","ordinal":170223,"en":"And heroes lying in wait."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l017","ordinal":170224,"en":"The cunning infidel Churok"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l018","ordinal":170225,"en":"Has a pit she dug,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l019","ordinal":170226,"en":"Misfortune she has set boiling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l020","ordinal":170227,"en":"And a great force the wretch"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l021","ordinal":170228,"en":"Has long prepared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l022","ordinal":170229,"en":"When an oppressor comes for you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l023","ordinal":170230,"en":"She has made ready;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l024","ordinal":170231,"en":"Aychurok, daughter of Akun,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l025","ordinal":170232,"en":"Has prepared"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l026","ordinal":170233,"en":"All her warriors."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l027","ordinal":170234,"en":"This infidel's man will not prosper;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l028","ordinal":170235,"en":"If he challenges Manas, he will not survive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l029","ordinal":170236,"en":"Mighty Manas took tribute"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l030","ordinal":170237,"en":"From Beijing untouched by Sulayman;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l031","ordinal":170238,"en":"Hero Manas left his mark"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l032","ordinal":170239,"en":"On Beijing untouched by Iskender."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1233:b003:l033","ordinal":170240,"en":"Mighty Manas conquered"}]
